FORBIDDEN ARCHIVE -- IRON SAND TECHNIQUES OF THE THIRD KAZEKAGE
Restricted. Kazekage Office authorization only.

The Third Kazekage is remembered as the strongest to hold the office. His
signature was the Iron Sand (satetsu): magnetic-release chakra imposed upon
ferrous particles, shaping them into blades, spires, and crushing weights of
near-limitless form. It was said to be the most feared weapon in Sunagakure's
history.

This power reportedly originated in his study of the One-Tail's sand and gold
dust manipulation. The Third's magnet release let him command iron sand as the
beast commanded its own.

Historical note: The Third Kazekage vanished without trace years ago. It was
later understood that he was abducted and slain, his body converted into a
human puppet by the traitor Sasori of the Red Sand, who thereafter wielded the
iron-sand techniques himself. Recovery of the Third's remains and the sealing
of these techniques remain standing objectives. No living shinobi is cleared
to reconstruct iron-sand jutsu. Sealed by order of the Kazekage.
